1 NOTE Paternal grandfather of Miles ("Neil"). Youngest of four children and only
2 CONT son, raised with three older sisters: Louise (Finke), Charlene (Wilke), and
2 CONT Mary Jane (Trapolin). At the end of WWII he engineered, installed, and
2 CONT instructed early radar systems on aircraft carriers. Married Joan Liebes for
2 CONT 56 years (implying a marriage circa 1961). Grandchildren listed in his 2017
2 CONT obituary: Zachary (26), Miles (24), Sydnie (22), Jennifer (18), Casey (17),
2 CONT Shelley (16), Carter (9), Cole (9).
