1 NOTE Paternal grandmother of Miles. Born Joan Liebes in Portland, Oregon, the
2 CONT daughter of George Julien Liebes and Edith (Wormser) Liebes and sister of
2 CONT George "Sonny" Liebes. Her father was a fur executive from the San Francisco
2 CONT fur house H. Liebes & Co. (founded 1864 by her great-grandfather Herman
2 CONT Liebes), which also had a Portland store - which explains an Oregon birth.
2 CONT The family was in San Francisco by 1939-40 and moved to Dallas when Joan was
2 CONT about eleven (c. 1942), where her father became a Neiman-Marcus fur buyer and
2 CONT vice president. Of Ashkenazi (German/Prussian Jewish) heritage.
