2 CONT the family naming line back to a Richard W. Thompson Sr. On 5 May 2018 he
2 CONT deeded his Collin County homestead to himself and his daughter Hilary Thompson
2 CONT Hutson as joint tenants with right of survivorship, reserving a life estate -
2 CONT the transaction later litigated in D'Olivio v. Hutson. Predeceased by his wife
2 CONT Euvonne (2007), his son Richard III (2013), and his daughter Elizabeth Jane.
