2 CONT science degree with Phi Beta Kappa. Brother: engineer Laurence K. Nelson of
2 CONT New Orleans (d. 1957), whose obituary names "a sister, Mrs. Miles B. Hutson."
2 CONT Her parents are not yet identified.
