1 TITL Hutson surname - etymology and history
1 PUBL WikiTree surname study; House of Names; archives.com
1 _URL https://www.wikitree.com/genealogy/HUTSON
1 _CONF Secondary
1 _ACC 2026-07-11
1 NOTE English patronymic surname derived from the medieval given name "Hudde"
2 CONT (a pet form of Hugh, "heart/mind," or a variant of Hudson). First recorded
2 CONT as William Hudde in the 1273 Hundred Rolls of Cambridgeshire, England.
2 CONT General surname background only - NOT evidence of this family's specific line.
