1 NOTE The anchor document for the paternal line. Establishes: death 20 Sep 2017 at
2 CONT age 89; birth in New Orleans to Miles and Adela Hutson; three older sisters
2 CONT Louise Finke, Charlene Wilke, Mary Jane Trapolin; Jesuit HS and Tulane (M.S.
2 CONT E.E. at age 20); WWII shipboard radar service; Chief Engineer at Chance
2 CONT Vought Electronics; founder of Hutson Corporation (1964); inventor of the
2 CONT world's smallest pistol scope; wife of 56 years Joan Liebes Hutson; children
2 CONT John Charles (Hilary), Paul Neil (Nicole), Mary Louise Suttles (Sonny);
2 CONT grandchildren Zachary, Miles, Sydnie, Jennifer, Casey, Shelley, Carter, Cole.
2 CONT Memorial service at Calvary Hill Cemetery, Dallas.
