1 NOTE Background on the prominent Liebes family of San Francisco: Herman Liebes
2 CONT (b. ~1842, German-Jewish immigrant) founded H. Liebes & Co., a leading Pacific
2 CONT fur house ("indisputably the largest dealers in sealskins in the world,"
2 CONT 1898-99 catalogue); active in B'nai B'rith and Congregation Emanu-El.
2 CONT First recorded (11 Jul 2026) as an unproven lead for Joan Liebes's
2 CONT ancestry; the link was proven on 23 Sep 2026 via the 1923 Wormser-Liebes
2 CONT wedding notice, the 1916 drowning reports and the 1950 census.
