1 NOTE "WORMSER-LIEBES - An interesting little home wedding solemnized Sunday was
2 CONT that of Miss Edith Wormser, daughter of Mrs. May Wormser, and Mr. George
2 CONT Julien Liebes, son of Mrs. Julien Liebes. The wedding took place at the home
2 CONT of the bride's cousin, Mrs. Sidney Herzog, 1919 Octavia street, at 3
2 CONT o'clock. The young couple have gone south for their honeymoon and will be
2 CONT away for two weeks. On their return they will live at the Hotel Fielding."
