2 CONT Liebes, member of the firm of H. Liebes & Co. of this city, and his
2 CONT thirteen-year-old son, George. Liebes lost his life, even as his wife and
2 CONT another son looked on. George Liebes was rescued ... Liebes' other son,
2 CONT Martin, 10 years old, also was in bathing." Julien was vice-president of H.
2 CONT Liebes & Co., "importers and dealers in Alaskan furs," a director in the
2 CONT Northern Commercial Company, and a member of the Concordia and Argonaut clubs.
